    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d118">

                <pb facs="0208" n="942" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg942"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Baron Fava to Mr. Gresham.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Personal.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of Italy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-03-16"><hi rendition="#italic">March 16,
                        1895</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear</hi> Mr. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Gresham</hi>:</p>
                <p>I am in receipt of your note of this date inclosing a copy of the telegram
                    addressed by you to his excellency the governor of Colorado, relating to the
                    killing of Italians at Walsenburg.</p>
                <p>In reply I hasten to inform you that a copy of said telegram will be forwarded at
                    once to his excellency Baron Blanc, who, I am sure, will share with me the full
                    appreciation of the course taken in this matter by the Federal Government as
                    well as by the governor of Colorado.</p>
                <p>With my personal thanks for your kind communication, I remain, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fava.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
